  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Semblance.Investigation.EvidenceItem
  prompt: Inspect
  id: semple_bed
  title: The bed in Room 3
  text: The bedspread is perfectly smooth, but there's a long, deep dent in the mattress under it, the shape of someone lying flat on their back with their arms at their sides. The dust on it is months old. Whatever lay here didn't toss or turn. It lay still, all summer, with its ear to the wall.
  subject: 
  customPrompt: Look at the bed
  nerveShock: 6
  awareness: 0
