  title: Nell's hymnal
  text: 'Nell''s hymnal, swollen with use. A ribbon marks ''Abide With Me''. In the margin, in her hand: ''Harlan''s hands were warm this morning. Thank you, Lord.'' The same line, every morning of September. October''s margins are blank.'
